"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"結婚の健康上の利益も計算に入れる。ただし観察データとして割り引いて考える"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"時間の計算は「無償労働」として算出し、役割分担を明確にしてから婚姻届を出す"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"結婚のお金の問題は、まず法律の標準ルールを確認し、書面での合意が必要かを決める"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"親が住宅購入資金を出す場合、送金時に「借入」か「贈与」かを明確に記載しておく"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"配偶者が一方的に多額の借金をした場合、あなたが署名せず、かつ追認もしていなければ、自動的にあなたの債務にはなりません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/10-13","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"婚姻届出は身分証と署名済みの申告書だけで可能。戸籍簿不要、費用無料、その場で交付"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"結婚前に一度結婚前検査を受け、重大な疾患がある場合は必ず登録前に相手に真実を伝えなければならない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"離脱コストを計算する：協議離婚には 30 日の冷静期があり、裁判離婚には法定条件がある"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"「親世代のための結婚」には別途勘定を立て、自分の勘定と混ぜないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"人間関係の良し悪しを健康の計算に入れておく：喧嘩は事柄に対して行い、人格を否定しない。罵倒や皮肉は避けること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"同性パートナーは、二人が意識がはっきりしているうちに、委任状、任意後見、および遺言を作成しておくべき：法律上、あなたたちは近親者ではないため、作成しなければ署名権も相続権もありません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"性的指向を隠して結婚しないで、偽装結婚を「手間の省ける方法」とも思わないこと：法律上、それは真の婚姻であり、解消したい場合は離婚の手続きを踏むしかない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/10-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"関係が繰り返される喧嘩や冷戦で停滞しているなら、二人でカップルセラピーを受けるべきです：ただ待っているだけでは、自然に良くなることは基本的にはありません"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/10"},"children":["第10章"," ·"," ","恋愛と結婚は損か得か"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"10-13"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["13"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["婚姻届出は身分証と署名済みの申告書だけで可能。戸籍簿不要、費用無料、その場で交付"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["2025 年 5 月より、婚姻届出には2つのものだけで足ります：本人の身分証、および署名済みの申告書です。申告書には、本人に配偶者がいないこと、および相手方と直系血族および三親等内の傍系血族の関係にないことを明記します。戸籍簿（戸口簿）の持参は不要で、一方の戸籍所在地に戻って手続きする必要もありません。登録費用は一切かからず、条件を満たせばその場で婚姻届が交付されます。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["無料。二人とも本人が立ち会う必要があります。手続き完了まで通常数十分です。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["2025 年 5 月 10 日より施行された新しい婚姻登録条例により、中国本土居住者の結婚時に提出が必要な書類が変更されました。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：婚姻届出は身分証と署名済みの申告書だけで可能。戸籍簿不要、費用無料、その場で交付"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"1